  "notes": "{飲|の}む is the basic verb for drinking any liquid. Also used for taking medicine and figuratively for accepting/swallowing conditions.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pattern: Xを{飲|の}む\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{飲|の}んでいる means \"is drinking\" (action in progress).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{水|みず}→水：02258_mizu⟧を{飲|の}む: to drink water\n- ⟦{薬|くすり}→薬：00793_kusuri⟧を{飲|の}む: to take medicine\n- お⟦{酒|さけ}→酒：02211_sake⟧を{飲|の}む: to drink alcohol\n- ⟦{条件|じょうけん}→条件：03285_jouken⟧を{飲|の}む: to accept/swallow conditions (figurative)\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- ⟦{飲|の}み{物|もの}→飲み物：02929_nomimono⟧: beverage, drink\n- ⟦{飲|の}み{会|かい}→飲み会：09371_nomikai⟧: drinking party\n- ⟦{飲|の}み{放題|ほうだい}→飲み放題：08308_nomihoudai⟧: all-you-can-drink",
